      "question": "How many issuers are in each sector, and what was each sector's median return over the 20 trading sessions ending August 31, 2026?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T21:32:33.157979Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T21:35:03.563214Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Sector‑level summary (20 trading sessions ending 2026‑08‑31)**\n\n| Sector | Issuers (count) | Median daily total return |\n|--------|----------------|---------------------------|\n| Construction | 41 | **+0.106 %** |\n| Finance, Insurance and Real Estate | 425 | **+0.082 %** |\n| Manufacturing | 792 | **+0.137 %** |\n| Mining | 119 | **‑0.098 %** |\n| Retail Trade | 138 | **‑0.057 %** |\n| Services | 304 | **+0.021 %** |\n| Transportation, Communications, Electric, Gas and Sanitary Services | 181 | **‑0.015 %** |\n\n*Values are median of the daily `total_return_1d` for each sector over the 20 most recent trading sessions up to 2026‑08‑31. Returns are shown as percentages (the source data reports fractions; e.g., 0.0010557 = 0.10557 %).*\n\n**Source:** Auto‑Ontology query on the synthetic market data pack (evidence [1]).\n\n**Limitations:** The dataset is synthetic; all issuers, prices, and sectors are fictional. No additional data‑quality issues were reported.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — synthetic_market — evidence `hermes-receipt:c4007556f37ca9fafc1e7aa40a018489547d4d4a109db044e938187717a4504f`",
